 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** Volume dataset with extinction coefficients $\tau(t)$ and color $C_{RGB}(t)$; ambient light intensity $I_A$; local neighborhood definition $N(s)$ (typically a sphere or box centered at sample point $s$).
